			<Item class="Script" referent="RBX4019">
				<Properties>
					<bool name="Disabled">false</bool>
					<Content name="LinkedSource"><null></null></Content>
					<string name="Name">Instructions By Ravoc</string>
					<ProtectedString name="Source">--[[How To Use Ravoc&apos;s Intro Message Kit V1.0

How Should I Arrange The Text?

Ok So Edit The Text Of The TextRow Buttons. The TextRow1
Goes First So Welcome This In This Row I.E. &quot;Welcome To My Game!&quot;
In Row 2 Try To Tell The What The Game Is About
In Row 3 Place Future Updates
In Row 4 Place Special News
In Row 5 I Like To Place Credits But Some Of You May Not Credit People
For Thier Model&apos;s....-_-
In Row 6 Place Recent Updates

Note These Are Suggestions On What To Put. They Seem To Look Nicer 
In This Fasion So I Highly Recomend It.

How Do I Add More Text Rows?

Copy Any Of The TextRow&apos;s And Right Click On Frame (The Frame The
Buttons Are In) And Click Paste. Name That Row TextRow8 To Help You.
Then Change The Position Of It Like So:

{0.550000012, 0}, {0.550000012, 0} 

{0.550000012, 0}, {0.6, 0}

Incase You Dont See It, I Simply Went From .55 To .6 And Rounded It
Up. So If It Is .9 Go Up To .95


Do I NEED To Give You Credit.

No, I Really Dont Care If You Credit Me Or Not. I Just Like Knowing That
Someone Copied It For The Following Reason:
If Someone Copies A Model, Then They Obviously Like It.



Thats All! Look For Future Updates!

Future Updates List:
Add More Rows To Start With
Neater Positioning
Add Seasonal Coloring












--]]</ProtectedString>
				</Properties>
			</Item>
